#: src/main.c:577
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Afsluiten"

#: src/dock_window.c:541
msgid ""
"A modern Wayland-native hackable desktop dock bar.\n"
"\n"
"Engineered with the performance of C and GTK4 Layer Shell for smooth auto-"
"hide and animations, featuring dynamic Wayland toplevel window tracking, "
"live CSS hot-reloading, and dynamic configuration powered by GNU Guile "
"Scheme."
msgstr ""
"Een moderne native en hackable Wayland desktop dock bar.\n"
"\n"
"Ontworpen met de performance van C en GTK4 Layer Shell voor soepele "
"animaties, ook met Wayland toplevel window tracking, auto-reload van CSS en "
"een dinamische configuratie, gedreven door GNU Guile Scheme."

#: src/dock_window.c:563
msgid "Find the project's source code here"
msgstr "Vind hier de broncode voor dit project"

